The faculties overlap a lot, but Health Sciences sits a little higher and Humanities a little lower. The ANOVA tests whether these differences exceed what chance would produce:

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("stress_anova ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("aov");#NormalTok("(stress ");#SpecialCharTok("~");#NormalTok(" faculty, ");#AttributeTok("data =");#NormalTok(" study)");],
[#FunctionTok("summary");#NormalTok("(stress_anova)");],));
