== The shape of a research project
<the-shape-of-a-research-project>
Every quantitative project follows roughly the same path, and this book has followed it too (#ref(<fig-project>, supplement: [Figure])).

#figure([
#block[
#box(image("19-putting-it-together_files\\figure-typst\\mermaid-figure-1.png", height: 8.9in, width: 3.41in))

]
