== The chain of reasoning
<the-chain-of-reasoning>
A result on its own is not yet a conclusion. Between the two lie the design that produced the data, the way the variables were measured, and the limits of both. #ref(<tbl-chain>, supplement: [Table]) traces the whole chain for the three research questions answered above, from the hypotheses stated in Chapter 5 to the limitations that a thesis discussion must acknowledge. Every result in it is filled in by the code of this chapter.

